---
import LegalPage from '../../components/LegalPage.astro';
import { site } from '../../data/site';
---

<LegalPage title="Privacy Policy" path="privacy">
	<p>Protecting your personal data matters to me. I process your data exclusively on the basis of the applicable legal provisions (GDPR, Austrian TKG 2021). This policy explains the key aspects of data processing on this website.</p>
	<h2>Controller</h2>
	<p>{site.name}, {site.address.join(', ')}, <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a></p>
	<h2>Hosting</h2>
	<p>This website is hosted by Netlify, Inc. (San Francisco, USA). When you visit the site, technically necessary data such as IP address, time of access, requested page and browser type are processed in server logs. The legal basis is Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR (legitimate interest in operating the website securely). Netlify is certified under the EU-US Data Privacy Framework. More information: <a href="https://www.netlify.com/privacy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">netlify.com/privacy</a>.</p>
	<h2>Getting in touch</h2>
	<p>If you contact me by email or phone, your details are stored to handle your request and any follow-up questions. The legal basis is Art. 6(1)(b) GDPR (pre-contractual measures). The data is deleted once it is no longer required and no statutory retention obligations apply.</p>
	<h2>Cookies and local storage</h2>
	<p>This website does not use cookies, analytics or tracking services. Your colour scheme preference (light/dark) is stored only locally in your browser and never transmitted to me.</p>
	<h2>Fonts</h2>
	<p>Fonts are served from this website's own server. No connection to Google Fonts or other third parties is made.</p>
	<h2>Your rights</h2>
	<p>You have the right to access, rectification, erasure, restriction, data portability and objection. If you believe the processing of your data violates data protection law, you can complain to me or to the Austrian Data Protection Authority: <a href="https://www.dsb.gv.at" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">www.dsb.gv.at</a>.</p>
</LegalPage>
